  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Women&#x2019;s Rights Programme in Kenya, implemented by ActionAid and local partners aims to support local women&apos;s organisations to be strong, resilient and representative. The main objective is to support women&apos;s organisations and women&apos;s groups to listen, understand and represent the needs of the communities and women in their target areas and use their analysis and advocacy skills to influence decision makers to take action on women&apos;s rights.  Objective: Women&apos;s organisations are representative of the needs of communities. Outcome: Cross cutting outcome -  Women&apos;s organisations are strong, resilient and representative</narrative>
  </description>
